### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### List books (solo activos; ?all=true para incluir archivados)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/book

### Libro por id (sustituye ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/book/REPLACE_OBJECT_ID

### Crear libro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clean Code",
  "description": "Robert C. Martin — buenas prácticas de software."
}

### Actualizar libro
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/book/REPLACE_OBJECT_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Descripción actualizada"
}

### Archivar (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/book/REPLACE_OBJECT_ID
